# Environment and credential files
# NOTE: .env files MUST be committed to the repo so the Emergent deployment
# system can auto-update them with production values at deploy time.
# Keeping them ignored caused production to start without MONGO_URL/DB_NAME →
# backend crashed at startup → "connect() failed (111: Connection refused)".
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key
.credentials
